===Etymology 2===
Origin unclear. Perhaps from the {{der|en|pld|-}} slang word {{m|en|balonie}}. Alternatively, perhaps simply from {{m|en|bologna||sausage}}, possibly used as a [[minced oath]] for {{m|en|bullshit}}.

